# Dark Matter Manipulator: "When this creature enters, mill three cards" and "+2/+0 for every seven cards in your graveyard".
# Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with a Mox Jet: the top three cards of its library (an Island, a Swamp and a Plains) go to its
# graveyard in that order, the library loses exactly three, and with three cards in the graveyard (not a full seven) it is
# still a 1/2.

